<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Suncrush lifts yr share, div up.</title>
<headline>Suncrush lifts yr share, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)	 69.8    vs    64.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)     17.5 making 23.0    vs    19.3</p>
<p>    Attrib income		148.99   vs    98.77</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			115.99   vs   117.49</p>
<p>    Tax			     40.01   vs    43.92</p>
<p>    Interest (paid)/received  (3.19)  vs     1.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     770.35   vs   708.06</p>
<p>Full name: Suncrush Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Softdrink bottler and marketer Suncrush said it would award capitalisation shares to shareeholders registered on September 13. The terms of the award would be announced around September 9.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
